保障交付质量符合研发规范。\n2. 负责现有系统的迭代优化与性能调优，定位并修复线上运行问题，持续提升系统的稳定性与响应效率。\n3. 配合产品、测试及前端团队完成需求联调与上线交付，同步编写对应的技术文档，保障项目全链路信息可追溯。\n4. 参与团队技术规范的落地执行，在开发过程中沉淀可复用的通用组件与工具，提升团队整体研发效率。\n任职要求\n1. 本科及以上学历，计算机相关专业，具备扎实的计算机网络、数据结构、操作系统等基础知识。\n2. 熟练掌握Java核心技术体系，熟悉IO、多线程、集合框架等底层原理，精通Spring、SpringBoot、MyBatis等主流开源框架的使用与机制。\n3. 具备关系型数据库（MySQL等）开发与优化能力，能够熟练编写复杂SQL，了解索引优化、事务机制等核心知识点，熟悉Redis、消息队列等常用中间件的使用场景。\n4. 具备良好的编码习惯与问题排查能力，有完整的企业级应用开发项目经验者优先，能够快速理解业务需求并转化为技术实现。\n5. 具备较强的责任心与团队协作意识，能够主动跟进开发进度，配合团队完成项目交付节点。","descriptionHighlight":"","highlightLabels":[],"labels":["Spring","Mybatis","MySQL","Redis","JAVA核心技术","系统性能调优","企业级应用开发"],"performanceBonus":"","welfareLabel":[],"welfareTags":[]},"jobType":{"jobType":"","jobTypeLevel":"9000300000000","jobTypeLevelName":"","subJobType":"","subJobTypeLevel":"9000300110000","subJobTypeLevelName":""},"onlineCarHailingExtend":{"gray":false,"promiseGuarantee":""},"onlineCarInfo":[],"other":{"customJobGroup":"DEFAULT","deliveredPreviouslyTip":"","jobKeyword":{"keywords":[]},"jobSkillTags":[],"jobTypeIsBlueCollar":false,"overseasList":[],"pageStyle":0,"positionCommercialLabel":[],"positionHighlight":"","propertyTypeUrl":"","rpoProxyDisplayOrgName":"","urgentRecruitmentUrl":""},"preferredHrInfo":{"icon":"","introduce":"","jumpUrl":"","preferredHr":false},"todayInterview":null,"workLocation":{"address":"工作地点：南沙区 · 横沥","addressType":0,"latitude":"22.766034618052807","longitude":"113.52472617707856","positionCityDistrict":"","positionCityDistrictCode":"","positionCityId":"763","positionWorkCity":"","showMap":true,"showMultiAddressesTip":"","staticMapUrl":"https://storage-public.zhaopin.cn/job/share/1789002099265167107/a04e686e63b541b7a47b479b9c92b5d1","streetName":"","tradingArea":"","travelMode":"bus","verifyTheTruthUrl":"","workAddress":"广州南沙越秀国际金融中心-A塔"}},"proxyWarning":null,"recommender":{"avatar":"","name":"","state":0,"text":"","title":""},"secure":{"abroadLabel":"","abroadTipInfo":null,"antiFraudGuide":null,"safeCenter":null,"safetyReminder":null},"staff"